# A style guide whose rules state the rule, its reason and its tag

The legend above the first section may name the tools: tidy checks every tag.

## Rules

- **Loops are bounded,** so that a violation fails fast instead of hanging. `[tidy:unbounded-loop]`
- **Never silence a lint.** A suppression hides the finding from the reviewer.
  `[clippy:allow_attributes]` `[dylint:nami_recursion]`
- Untidy prose is a review matter. `[review]`

```rust
// Code blocks may name tidy and clippy.
```
